        "Infrastructure original runner path_leakage case passes bundle.relative_to(out), records boolean stderr match, then deletes negative_cases"
      ],
      "remediation": "Runtime owner should normalize the bundle root and test the original path-portability contract on non-home mount paths; Infrastructure runner should retain exact per-case stderr. Do not weaken expected host-private-path rejection."
